# Personalized audio: clips of the learner's own answers — their name, address,
# birth year, their grandmother. Generated locally, never committed. This repo
# is public and the filenames are opaque hashes, so without this rule a routine
# `git add -A` would publish a recording of someone's family details.
public/audio/me/
profile.local.json
